faithful high-level match.\",\n      \"evidence\": \"The formal description says it uses the same induction on n, adds n+1, and simplifies the polynomial at the successor step.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"omissions\": \"The input contains no exact formal statement or proof term to inspect. No other exposition assertions or passages were present.\",\n  \"toolsUsed\": \"Read /procedure.md and /input/INPUT.md with the shell. No Ladon, Lean, library build, or external lookup was used.\",\n  \"checkingStatus\": \"No Lean checks were performed; the input provides a rendered description rather than an original Lean module.\"\n}"}}
